## Vector Store Patterns

### Qdrant Integration
```python
from langchain_qdrant import QdrantVectorStore
from qdrant_client import QdrantClient
from qdrant_client.http.models import Distance, VectorParams

# Use persistent Qdrant (see @project-fundamentals for URLs)
client = QdrantClient(host="localhost", port=6333)  # From project-fundamentals

# Create collection (see @project-fundamentals for all values)
client.create_collection(
    collection_name="ai_usage_knowledge_index",  # From project-fundamentals
    vectors_config=VectorParams(size=768, distance=Distance.COSINE),  # From project-fundamentals
)

vector_store = QdrantVectorStore(
    client=client,
    collection_name="ai_usage_knowledge_index",  # From project-fundamentals
    embedding=embedding_model,
)
```

### Retriever Configuration
```python
# k value from project-fundamentals
retriever = vector_store.as_retriever(search_kwargs={"k": 5})  # From project-fundamentals
```

